Summary
ESP32 Framework Core is intended to be a long-term, extensible firmware platform rather than a single-purpose sketch.
It emphasizes:
* Stability
* Scalability
* Maintainability
* Diagnostics
* Remote operations
This makes it suitable for serious embedded deployments and future commercial expansion.
